      "Atziri Flameblast":"^7Used to fill in defaults for specific boss skills if the boss config is not set\n\nBosses' damage is modified by roll range configuration, defaulted at a 70% roll, at the normal monster level for your character level (capped at 85)\nFill in the exact damage numbers if more precision is needed\n\n^7Atziri Flameblast: The Uber variant has 10 ^xB97123Fire^7 penetration (Applied on Pinnacle And Uber)",
      "Cortex Ground Degen":"^7Used to fill in defaults for specific boss skills if the boss config is not set\n\nBosses' damage is modified by roll range configuration, defaulted at a 70% roll, at the normal monster level for your character level (capped at 85)\nFill in the exact damage numbers if more precision is needed\n\n^7Cortex Ground Degen: Damage Over Time skill",
      "Eater Beam":"^7Used to fill in defaults for specific boss skills if the boss config is not set\n\nBosses' damage is modified by roll range configuration, defaulted at a 70% roll, at the normal monster level for your character level (capped at 85)\nFill in the exact damage numbers if more precision is needed\n\n^7Eater Beam: Allocating Insatiable Appetite causes the beam to always shock for at least 30%",
      "Exarch Ball":"^7Used to fill in defaults for specific boss skills if the boss config is not set\n\nBosses' damage is modified by roll range configuration, defaulted at a 70% roll, at the normal monster level for your character level (capped at 85)\nFill in the exact damage numbers if more precision is needed\n\n^7Exarch Ball: Spawns 8-18 waves of balls depending on which fight and which ball phase, Cannot be Blocked, Dodged, or Suppressed",
      "Maven Fireball":"^7Used to fill in defaults for specific boss skills if the boss config is not set\n\nBosses' damage is modified by roll range configuration, defaulted at a 70% roll, at the normal monster level for your character level (capped at 85)\nFill in the exact damage numbers if more precision is needed\n\n^7Maven Fireball: Allocating Throw the Gauntlet increases Damage by a further 100% (Applied on Uber) and causes the fireball to have 30 ^xB97123Fire^7 penetration (Applied on Uber)",
      "Maven Memory Game":"^7Used to fill in defaults for specific boss skills if the boss config is not set\n\nBosses' damage is modified by roll range configuration, defaulted at a 70% roll, at the normal monster level for your character level (capped at 85)\nFill in the exact damage numbers if more precision is needed\n\n^7Maven Memory Game: Cannot be Blocked, Dodged, or Suppressed. \n\tIt is three separate hits, and has a large DoT effect.  Neither is taken into account here.  \n\t\ti.e. Hits before death should be more than 3 to survive",
      "None":"^7Used to fill in defaults for specific boss skills if the boss config is not set\n\nBosses' damage is modified by roll range configuration, defaulted at a 70% roll, at the normal monster level for your character level (capped at 85)\nFill in the exact damage numbers if more precision is needed",
      "Shaper Ball":"^7Used to fill in defaults for specific boss skills if the boss config is not set\n\nBosses' damage is modified by roll range configuration, defaulted at a 70% roll, at the normal monster level for your character level (capped at 85)\nFill in the exact damage numbers if more precision is needed\n\n^7Shaper Ball: Allocating Cosmic Wounds increases the penetration to 40% (Applied on Uber) and adds 2 projectiles",
      "Shaper Beam":"^7Used to fill in defaults for specific boss skills if the boss config is not set\n\nBosses' damage is modified by roll range configuration, defaulted at a 70% roll, at the normal monster level for your character level (capped at 85)\nFill in the exact damage numbers if more precision is needed\n\n^7Shaper Beam: Damage Over Time skill",
      "Shaper Slam":"^7Used to fill in defaults for specific boss skills if the boss config is not set\n\nBosses' damage is modified by roll range configuration, defaulted at a 70% roll, at the normal monster level for your character level (capped at 85)\nFill in the exact damage numbers if more precision is needed\n\n^7Shaper Slam: Cannot be Evaded.  Allocating Cosmic Wounds increases Damage by a further 100% (Applied on Uber) and cannot be blocked or dodged",
      "Sirus Meteor":"^7Used to fill in defaults for specific boss skills if the boss config is not set\n\nBosses' damage is modified by roll range configuration, defaulted at a 70% roll, at the normal monster level for your character level (capped at 85)\nFill in the exact damage numbers if more precision is needed\n\n^7Sirus Meteor: Earlier ones with less walls do less damage. Allocating The Perfect Storm increases Damage by a further 50% (Applied on Uber)"
